<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT TURKEY 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRANCE BEAT TURKEY 4-0 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat Turkey 4-0 (halftime 2-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Laurent Blanc (33rd), Reynald Pedros (35th), Youri Djorkaeff (50th), Robert Pires (83rd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 28,611</p>
